        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A herringbone half treble placemat is a 30 × 40 cm rectangle worked in "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "herringbone half treble",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "herringbone-htr"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ": a stitch that pulls the working yarn through the first loop only before completing, producing a tight diagonal texture. The result is denser than standard htr with a woven look. DK cotton on a 4.5 mm hook gives a flexible, slightly padded placemat."
          }
        ]
      },
